# The store (docs/V3.md section 8): parallel appends merge without conflict; the reader accepts any
# order and duplicate lines, and `warrant fmt` restores the canonical order. Its bytes are hashed and
# signed: never converted (-text).
.warrant/records.jsonl merge=union -text
.warrant/blobs/** -text
# Entries and mutant rows that two pull requests add at the same place keep both: a local merge of the base
# then needs no resolution, and the merge gate holds such a head to the reviewed commit's clean merge with the
# base (docs/V3.md section 14). tests/mutants.py refuses an id named twice.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
tests/mutants.py merge=union
